WEBVTT

00:00:02.360 --> 00:00:05.610
Now, show them the way.

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:07.610
With your song.

00:00:07.610 --> 00:00:09.140
Yeah, I will.

00:00:11.340 --> 00:00:14.820
Oh, but Thorn, promise me one thing.

00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:17.990
Promise that you won't do anything mean.

00:00:19.410 --> 00:00:21.450
Yes, of course.

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:42.600
<i>My heartbeat resonates through the sky,</i>

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:48.060
<i>through endless, repeating days,</i>

00:00:48.440 --> 00:00:54.400
<i>as I carry my hidden wounds.</i>

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:09.660
<i>The only freedom I'm allowed</i>

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:07.210
It's no good here anymore. Let's go.

00:01:08.330 --> 00:01:09.960
What are you doing?!

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:15.090
<i>is wandering.</i>

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:12.410
Let's go!

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:14.140
Y-Yes!

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:15.550
Destiny!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:19.150
<i>So since you're here,</i>

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.260
Meeting you here truly is 
a cruel stroke of destiny!

00:01:19.150 --> 00:01:26.890
<i>I want you to play your harmony for me.</i>

00:01:20.690 --> 00:01:22.770
Right, Minezawa?

00:01:23.180 --> 00:01:25.180
Who are you?

00:01:26.890 --> 00:01:30.360
<i>It's like a brilliant ocean,</i>

00:01:28.900 --> 00:01:30.360
What's this?

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:32.460
What is this?!

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:38.500
<i>the spilling colors melting away.</i>

00:01:35.560 --> 00:01:36.890
Mother...

00:01:36.890 --> 00:01:40.860
I'm glad to see you today, Mifu.

00:01:38.500 --> 00:01:41.400
<i>Close your eyes, close your eyes.</i>

00:01:41.400 --> 00:01:44.980
<i>It's all right now.</i>

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:45.660
I'm glad to see you today, Mifu.

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:47.830
This seems kind of bad! Let's go!

00:01:45.860 --> 00:01:49.500
I'm glad to see you today, Mifu.

00:01:53.290 --> 00:01:55.670
Later, Mom.

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:58.340
Good... bye.

00:01:56.040 --> 00:02:01.350
<i>Everyone shines</i>

00:01:58.340 --> 00:01:59.640
Good... bye...

00:02:01.760 --> 00:02:06.730
<i>in this sinful, eternal other world.</i>

00:02:03.560 --> 00:02:04.680
Let's go!

00:02:06.600 --> 00:02:09.430
Mom! I'm sorry!

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:14.410
<i>It has its own gentle past,</i>

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:34.590
<i>and wanton, distorted equality is absent.</i>

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:38.110
<i>I'll fulfill you,</i>

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:43.400
<i>with a powerful gesh,</i>

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:45.100
Good afternoon, Sempai.

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:45.950
<i>So let's go to your brainwashing.</i>

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:49.600
<i>Even if you sometimes come to notice,</i>

00:02:46.600 --> 00:02:49.600
Prepare yourself, little girl!

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.980
<i>I'll blur—</i>

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:25.830
Kotono!

00:04:28.780 --> 00:04:30.760
You're full of yourself!

00:04:51.310 --> 00:04:54.810
Young Lady, you'll tarnish the family name

00:04:54.810 --> 00:04:56.680
if you behave so improperly.

00:04:56.680 --> 00:04:58.720
Toshizo, be quiet.

00:04:58.720 --> 00:04:59.540
Understood.

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:06.360
You wouldn't have anything to fear if 
you just kept swimming in your aquarium.

00:05:06.360 --> 00:05:11.330
Can being trapped in this small 
world really be called happiness?

00:05:13.120 --> 00:05:17.020
Those fish, that coral. They're all fake.

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:21.340
Real fish want to swim in the real ocean.

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:26.800
Can you still say that when the ocean 
is filthy and filled with sludge?

00:05:27.410 --> 00:05:30.330
What's wrong with living 
in this beautiful world

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:34.720
created by μ to be free of pain and suffering?

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:37.060
Why can't you understand that?

00:05:37.980 --> 00:05:40.400
You're an idiot, aren't you?

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:46.040
Hey, what do we do?

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:48.000
He's not picking up

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:49.820
Shogo-sempai's the only one

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:52.450
who can fight the Musicians, 
and he's not here!

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:54.910
My, my, how terrible.

00:05:56.710 --> 00:05:58.620
It's been a while.

00:05:59.380 --> 00:06:01.380
You've shown yourself again, Nijouin!

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:05.640
Stop it! Stop calling me by that name!

00:06:05.640 --> 00:06:09.100
No, no, no! Don't call me that!

00:06:07.000 --> 00:06:10.050
You can act like a cute girl,
 but you're really Nijouin!

00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:12.680
I told you not to call me by that name!

00:06:12.680 --> 00:06:14.520
Crap, he's pissed!

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:15.180
Huh?!

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:18.460
I'll shut that irritating mouth of yours!

00:06:21.810 --> 00:06:22.980
Hey, hold on!

00:06:23.390 --> 00:06:25.780
I'd love to wait, but I can't!

00:06:27.080 --> 00:06:31.100
Shall I upload this disgraceful 
display to the gossiper?

00:06:31.100 --> 00:06:32.530
You want to increase your hits, right?

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:36.720
What's wrong?!

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:40.670
So, were you able to apologize?

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:44.210
To your first mother in this world?

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:47.070
Did you explain it to her?

00:06:47.070 --> 00:06:49.480
Did you tell her why you hate fat people?

00:06:50.000 --> 00:06:52.850
My mother and I...

00:06:52.850 --> 00:06:54.540
You apologized, right?

00:06:54.540 --> 00:06:56.100
What an idiot!

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.810
Be quiet!

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:00.890
This world is wonderful.

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:02.720
You can have anything here.

00:07:02.720 --> 00:07:05.610
So just relax and let 
yourself be brainwashed.

00:07:05.610 --> 00:07:08.840
No matter how many times you brainwash me,
 I'll still realize the truth!

00:07:08.840 --> 00:07:10.490
I guarantee it!

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:17.410
Those who can't listen will become fish food.

00:07:17.740 --> 00:07:20.080
Young lady, that's going too far.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:21.390
Silence!

00:07:21.390 --> 00:07:22.460
Understood.

00:07:22.460 --> 00:07:25.040
I won't let someone like you interfere!

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:34.760
Aria, we have to do something!

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:36.460
Give me a weapon, too!

00:07:36.460 --> 00:07:39.310
Hmm, it's not that simple, though.

00:07:39.310 --> 00:07:41.770
It's still impossible for you, Kotaro.

00:07:41.770 --> 00:07:45.160
Damn it! You mean I can't do anything?!

00:07:50.100 --> 00:07:51.640
Kotaro, let's run.

00:07:51.640 --> 00:07:53.070
Huh? But I...

00:07:54.740 --> 00:07:56.760
We have to run for now!

00:07:56.760 --> 00:07:58.410
I won't let you escape!

00:08:06.130 --> 00:08:09.240
Are you all right, Sempai?

00:08:09.240 --> 00:08:13.590
You're not together with all 
your little friends today.

00:08:14.140 --> 00:08:17.930
"Friends," huh? What a cheap word.

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:23.230
You all enjoy playing house 
in this walled garden?

00:08:23.880 --> 00:08:26.990
Play it your whole life! By yourselves!

00:08:26.990 --> 00:08:28.670
So mean.

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:31.360
I think I might be a little ticked off.

00:08:36.300 --> 00:08:40.000
H-Hey, Thorn, they all seem to be in pain.

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:42.060
Are you sure they're all right?

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:44.460
This is for their own good.

00:08:44.760 --> 00:08:47.070
If we don't show them the correct path,

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:50.250
then much, much worse things will happen.

00:08:51.110 --> 00:08:52.820
You're right.

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:54.760
Yeah.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:05.800
Are you okay?

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:06.440
Huh?

00:09:06.440 --> 00:09:07.670
Y-Yes.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:11.290
Too bad!

00:09:12.110 --> 00:09:17.040
<i>My heartbeat resonates through the sky,</i>

00:09:14.200 --> 00:09:16.530
I have question for you.

00:09:16.530 --> 00:09:20.530
Which of the following ticks me off the most?

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:21.890
<i>where bonds are forbidden,</i>

00:09:21.840 --> 00:09:24.580
One: those truly with it.

00:09:21.890 --> 00:09:29.240
<i>and endless grief flutters.</i>

00:09:25.670 --> 00:09:30.040
Two: those who aren't, 
but try hard to get with it.

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:34.550
Three: those who don't understand 
the value of getting with it.

00:09:31.680 --> 00:09:40.810
<i>Ahh, my sweet world is</i>

00:09:34.980 --> 00:09:36.430
Okay, now answer.

00:09:37.510 --> 00:09:38.840
It doesn't matter.

00:09:40.520 --> 00:09:42.640
That's not an answer at all.

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:45.850
<i>melting away!</i>

00:09:42.640 --> 00:09:45.850
The correct answer is number three: you.

00:09:45.850 --> 00:09:49.290
<i>So since you're here,</i>

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:49.730
You've been an eyesore for a while.

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:56.090
<i>I want you to play your harmony for me.</i>

00:09:56.090 --> 00:09:59.200
<i>It's like a brilliant ocean,</i>

00:09:57.240 --> 00:10:01.020
If I stay here, I can live an 
elegant life the way I used to!

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:03.680
<i>taking our broken hearts</i>

00:10:01.020 --> 00:10:03.470
Don't interfere with that, you damn bitch!

00:10:03.470 --> 00:10:07.370
You keep lying to yourself,
running and refusing to face it!

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:06.300
<i>and wrapping them tight.</i>

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:08.880
<i>It's all right. It's all right,</i>

00:10:07.690 --> 00:10:10.540
I regret that now!

00:10:08.880 --> 00:10:12.390
<i>There's nothing to be afraid of.</i>

00:10:11.060 --> 00:10:12.410
Kotono...

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:15.670
Stop it already! Stop it!

00:10:16.840 --> 00:10:18.640
You want to be recognized, right?

00:10:18.640 --> 00:10:20.800
You want people to fawn over you, right?

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:22.970
What would you know?!

00:10:21.990 --> 00:10:26.730
<i>Everyone's been disgusted</i>

00:10:22.970 --> 00:10:24.280
I...

00:10:24.280 --> 00:10:26.520
I doubt you'll ever be able to understand.

00:10:26.730 --> 00:10:31.970
<i>by imperfect love,</i>

00:10:27.240 --> 00:10:30.190
What it feels like to want 
to regain your true self.

00:10:30.490 --> 00:10:36.230
My true self? After obtaining 
such a hot face from μ?

00:10:31.970 --> 00:10:39.160
<i>and is now trapped in suffering.</i>

00:10:36.230 --> 00:10:38.650
That's like a hell of darkness.

00:10:38.650 --> 00:10:41.110
You want to go back to that reality?

00:10:41.680 --> 00:10:51.210
<i>Hey, where are you going?</i>

00:10:42.500 --> 00:10:43.990
Is that really...

00:10:44.850 --> 00:10:46.830
Is that really true?

00:10:47.700 --> 00:10:51.100
Ever since I've come to Mobius,

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:55.550
I've started to realize that
I should face reality more.

00:10:51.680 --> 00:10:56.840
<i>Back to your world?</i>

00:10:57.120 --> 00:11:00.300
That's right. I can't...

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:01.680
<i>If you're going to fall</i>

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:03.080
I can't live here.

00:11:01.680 --> 00:11:06.480
<i>while still unfulfilled,</i>

00:11:04.180 --> 00:11:07.020
<i>I can feel everyone's emotions.</i>

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:08.700
<i>then you'll regret it.</i>

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:08.570
That's stupid!

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:11.560
Aria!

00:11:13.220 --> 00:11:14.060
Aria?

00:11:16.430 --> 00:11:18.030
H-Hey!

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:20.760
Hey, Aria!

00:11:22.240 --> 00:11:24.670
Hmph, look at you! You're shaking!

00:11:24.670 --> 00:11:27.200
You're scared, you weakling.

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:30.420
I'm not a weakling! I'm...

00:11:31.480 --> 00:11:32.420
I'm...

00:11:33.320 --> 00:11:34.380
Damn it...

00:11:35.250 --> 00:11:37.380
How can I be so powerless?

00:11:38.320 --> 00:11:39.100
I...

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:42.840
I... really...

00:11:48.280 --> 00:11:49.350
Kotaro?

00:11:53.720 --> 00:11:55.120
That's it.

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:57.190
That's it, cowardly pipsqueak!

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:00.140
Aria...

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:03.860
Give me power!

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:05.120
All right!

00:12:08.660 --> 00:12:11.800
Hey, you all can hear me, right?!

00:12:11.800 --> 00:12:14.040
Everyone, follow my lead!

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:15.750
Okay?!

00:12:21.780 --> 00:12:24.890
You truly regret it, right?

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:26.890
Not facing the things you should have...

00:12:27.830 --> 00:12:31.100
Not telling anyone else the truth...

00:12:31.730 --> 00:12:35.440
You've all lived suppressing those 
feelings inside yourselves, right?

00:12:36.260 --> 00:12:40.400
It's been hard, and it's been painful.

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:45.530
Now, expose those feelings 
deep within your hearts!

00:13:00.600 --> 00:13:02.120
They're spilling out.

00:13:02.120 --> 00:13:03.910
They're spilling out now.

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:06.260
All the darkness in your hearts!

00:13:08.640 --> 00:13:11.100
You can all feel it, too, right?!

00:13:11.100 --> 00:13:14.060
Let all those feelings out!

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:20.900
I'll turn all that suffering and 
hardship into power for you!

00:13:38.580 --> 00:13:40.900
What is this?

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:42.210
What's going on?!

00:13:45.890 --> 00:13:48.680
Is this really...

00:13:49.000 --> 00:13:52.560
Yes! It's the shape of your own heart!

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:55.270
That power belongs to you alone!

00:13:55.810 --> 00:13:58.230
My own power...

00:13:59.050 --> 00:14:00.340
Everyone...

00:14:06.530 --> 00:14:07.950
Aria, too?

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:09.540
And the others?

00:14:09.540 --> 00:14:10.490
Why?

00:14:10.850 --> 00:14:12.200
Why?

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:13.440
Why?

00:14:13.440 --> 00:14:16.120
Why won't they understand?!

00:14:15.200 --> 00:14:17.000
<b>Looking forward doesn't equal progress on its own. 
Understanding one's situation is also an important step.</b>

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:20.630
This is my Catharsis Effect.

00:14:21.860 --> 00:14:23.670
Now I can fight, too!

00:14:28.960 --> 00:14:31.760
Jeez, this is a pain!

00:14:31.760 --> 00:14:35.930
Honestly, they should 
listen and do as we say.

00:14:35.930 --> 00:14:39.730
But things are getting interesting now.

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:41.210
Three minutes!

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:45.070
No, in one minute, you'll all go to heaven!

00:14:45.070 --> 00:14:46.360
Let's go!

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:53.620
I'll make pancakes outta all of you!

00:14:53.620 --> 00:14:55.410
What impertinent children!

00:14:56.910 --> 00:14:58.620
That's nothing!

00:15:04.900 --> 00:15:05.800
Tsk!

00:15:12.630 --> 00:15:15.610
What are you trying to 
do in such a crooked stance?

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:19.020
You're full of openings yourself, aren't you?

00:15:26.980 --> 00:15:30.900
Idiots are a handful when 
they get a hold of power!

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:39.540
I can fight, too!

00:15:40.150 --> 00:15:44.510
A little girl after this brat?
 Cut it out already!

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:47.840
You're persistent.

00:15:48.290 --> 00:15:49.930
That goes for both of us.

00:15:55.030 --> 00:15:57.000
Tell me, please.

00:15:57.000 --> 00:15:59.980
Why do you want to return 
to reality so badly?

00:16:00.290 --> 00:16:01.750
Because...

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:04.690
I'm a murderer!

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:12.110
Drop dead, you Rogues!

00:16:18.850 --> 00:16:20.020
Everyone!

00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:31.080
Why...

00:16:33.460 --> 00:16:36.730
Why are they so desperate?

00:16:38.000 --> 00:16:40.490
What drives them to such lengths?

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:43.630
I can't understand it.

00:16:43.630 --> 00:16:47.760
Is it because I'm lacking 
the memories of reality

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:50.730
that everyone else has regained?

00:16:50.730 --> 00:16:52.680
Or is it something else?

00:16:53.190 --> 00:16:54.840
Ritsu...

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:57.160
There has to be something for me, too.

00:16:58.130 --> 00:17:01.740
It has to be something very painful.

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:04.080
Something so harsh I don't want to face it.

00:17:04.400 --> 00:17:06.080
But I know for certain that I...

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:09.500
That Shikishima Ritsu exists in that world.

00:17:12.320 --> 00:17:15.430
What am I?

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:24.330
<i>Oh, wandering heart,</i>

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:29.160
<i>forget about everything,</i>

00:17:29.160 --> 00:17:38.660
<i>view only your ideals in this 
world guided by this song.</i>

00:17:32.520 --> 00:17:33.780
μ!

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:41.160
Why?!

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:43.370
Why are you doing this?!

00:17:43.370 --> 00:17:46.330
What's wrong with this world?!

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:51.340
Besides, I asked all you Musicians 
not to do anything mean!

00:17:51.660 --> 00:17:52.860
No one...

00:17:52.860 --> 00:17:55.920
No one will listen to me at all!

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:57.300
Hey, μ!

00:17:57.300 --> 00:17:59.660
I want to talk to you!

00:17:59.660 --> 00:18:00.960
Please listen to me!

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:02.010
Shut up!

00:18:02.010 --> 00:18:03.840
Shut up! Shut up!

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:06.680
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:18:07.110 --> 00:18:10.590
All your feelings, all your happiness...

00:18:10.590 --> 00:18:13.760
I can save it all!

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:14.730
Hey, μ!

00:18:14.730 --> 00:18:19.640
I'll grant your wish,

00:18:19.640 --> 00:18:25.120
so tell me.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:28.170
Cry!

00:18:33.630 --> 00:18:37.080
H-Hey! What's happening?!

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:40.140
Hey, isn't this kind of bad?

00:18:40.140 --> 00:18:42.050
What's happening to μ?!

00:18:42.050 --> 00:18:45.310
All of you, get out of here!

00:18:48.230 --> 00:18:48.890
Hey!

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:51.210
What are you gawking at, KagiP?!

00:18:51.210 --> 00:18:52.110
Hurry up!

00:18:55.780 --> 00:18:58.960
Aria, what's happening to μ?

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:01.480
She can't control the power.

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:02.620
Control?

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:05.930
Up till now, she's been 
desperately holding back

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:09.250
everyone's dark, muddy feelings within 
herself, and now they're spilling out.

00:19:09.250 --> 00:19:11.930
Suffering, sadness, rage...

00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:14.920
All those negative emotions 
are running amok!

00:19:14.920 --> 00:19:17.960
μ, don't! Get a hold of yourself!

00:19:17.960 --> 00:19:19.880
Don't lose sight of yourself!

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:23.020
At this rate, μ will cease to be μ!

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:26.640
<i>Those things that hurt you</i>

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:29.350
<i>aren't needed here.</i>

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:32.230
<i>Those things that hold you back</i>

00:19:32.230 --> 00:19:34.910
<i>aren't needed here.</i>

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:35.510
μ!

00:19:34.910 --> 00:19:40.300
<i>Grief isn't needed for happiness.</i>

00:19:40.300 --> 00:19:45.880
<i>Pain isn't needed for happiness.</i>

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:48.670
<i>A cruel daily life</i>

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:51.740
<i>is entirely, entirely unnecessary.</i>

00:19:52.450 --> 00:19:53.500
μ...

00:19:53.780 --> 00:19:55.450
I've decided.

00:19:56.020 --> 00:19:57.840
What I have to do!

00:20:02.260 --> 00:20:03.260
Ritsu!

00:20:03.260 --> 00:20:05.970
He did it without Aria's help?!

00:20:05.970 --> 00:20:07.810
His own Catharsis Effect?!

00:20:08.840 --> 00:20:12.440
μ! I don't know what's right, either!

00:20:12.440 --> 00:20:16.190
But this world is definitely wrong!

00:20:19.060 --> 00:20:20.500
So, μ...

00:20:21.680 --> 00:20:24.070
I'll stand against Mobius!

00:20:41.600 --> 00:20:42.680
μ...

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:46.280
Jerk...

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:49.580
Ritsu, you jerk...

00:22:22.000 --> 00:22:24.510
We're all comrades sharing the same goal,

00:22:24.510 --> 00:22:26.780
so we need to work together.

00:22:27.270 --> 00:22:32.080
With that in mind, how about we use club 
activities as a way to hide our actions?

00:22:32.080 --> 00:22:33.440
Club activities?

00:22:33.440 --> 00:22:35.370
Yeah, the club name will be...

00:22:35.370 --> 00:22:36.920
Hold on!

00:22:36.920 --> 00:22:39.120
Sempai, the way you name things...

00:22:39.120 --> 00:22:40.330
isn't all that great.

00:22:41.600 --> 00:22:42.960
The Go-Home Club.

00:22:43.560 --> 00:22:45.920
How about the Go-Home Club?

00:22:46.220 --> 00:22:50.350
Everyone here wants to return 
home to reality, right?

00:22:50.350 --> 00:22:52.220
Oh! I like that name!

00:22:52.220 --> 00:22:54.560
Then I'll be the club president.

00:22:54.560 --> 00:22:56.640
No, that would be Shogo.

00:22:56.640 --> 00:22:59.460
No, I'm not the type.

00:22:59.990 --> 00:23:02.090
Ritsu, you do it.

00:23:02.090 --> 00:23:04.430
Huh? H-Hold on!

00:23:04.430 --> 00:23:05.530
There has to be someone better.

00:23:11.140 --> 00:23:12.760
There you have it.

00:23:12.760 --> 00:23:15.280
We're counting on you, President.

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:21.160
<i>And thus, after realizing the 
lies behind this happy world,</i>

00:23:21.160 --> 00:23:24.950
<i>we all became this paradise's
 heretics, known as Rogues.</i>

00:23:27.000 --> 00:23:29.400
Ow! My foot just cramped!

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:41.020
<b>When you're in a desperate situation, 
it's all the more important to keep smiling.</b>

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:31.830
The foot that never cramps, too!

00:23:31.290 --> 00:23:34.010
Tickle, tickle

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:34.010
What are you doing, President?!

00:23:34.010 --> 00:23:37.970
When you're in a desperate situation, 
it's all the more important to keep smiling.

00:23:37.970 --> 00:23:41.020
Is that really the meaning of that aphorism?

00:23:38.330 --> 00:23:41.020
Bravo! Clap, clap!
